{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/720730/extras/a92d1842a6cf8eeae5399e107ffb5c70.avif?t=1759878091\" width=610 height=70 /></span><br><br><i>Without Escape</i> harkens back to first-person graphic adventures of the early \u201890s, which relied on pre-rendered backgrounds and full-motion video to tell interactive stories. Explore the confines of your own home as you flip between a mundane existence and a horrifying otherworld. Can you escape the nightmare and find the answers you\u2019re looking for?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/720730/extras/ce296dee261064eb8f8b93d03253e5f8.avif?t=1759878091\" width=610 height=70 /></span><br><br>One chilly winter night, you go home and notice that nobody\u2019s there. Your parents had told you that they would be visiting your grandparents for the weekend, so you give their absence no mind and go to bed.<br><br>At 2:45 a.m., your sleep is suddenly interrupted by strange noises. A burglar, perhaps? You decide to investigate \u2013 only to plunge into a nightmarish web of stone, flesh, and flame.<br><br>With no way to return to what you thought was reality, you must unravel the secret of your home\u2019s transformation. Are you prepared to endure the horrors that await you?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/720730/extras/48ad1d309aafcf10f8ec3a8996392b43.avif?t=1759878091\" width=610 height=70 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> \t<li>Reconnect with the past through classic point-and-click exploration.<br>\t</li><li>Overcome enigmatic puzzles that will test your wits.<br> \t</li><li>Play your way with gamepad, keyboard and mouse support.<br> \t</li><li>Immerse yourself in your home\u2019s oppressive atmosphere with an atmospheric soundtrack.<br> \t</li><li>Gaze upon 1080p pre-rendered backgrounds \u2013 in your old home, which has become a hellish nightmare.<br> \t</li><li>Discover multiple endings, secrets, and Easter eggs.<br> \t</li><li>Race against your friends and others with online leaderboards.<br> \t</li><li>Unlock several achievements.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4475bb4fc519480814dced77e02539dbf9e188be.jpg","localized_name":"Never around when you need them","name":"Never around when you need them","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/720730/4475bb4fc519480814dced77e02539dbf9e188be.jpg"},{"icon":"eb3c2621e600769fc97a7c4ea2f9d159b639b5a7.jpg","localized_name":"Became the new Maker","name":"Became the new Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/720730/eb3c2621e600769fc97a7c4ea2f9d159b639b5a7.jpg"},{"icon":"756893dc2e4c9905998fde5b34429809de21d07c.jpg","localized_name":"Jumped into the void","name":"Jumped into the void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/720730/756893dc2e4c9905998fde5b34429809de21d07c.jpg"},{"icon":"51a4d1e177e340165d082c311fdeea43d47265ac.jpg","localized_name":"Did you think you would make it?","name":"Did you think you would make it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/720730/51a4d1e177e340165d082c311fdeea43d47265ac.jpg"},{"icon":"a168ee8c102a70d103dc9fa9b67afd987b3df169.jpg","localized_name":"Where's the air conditioner?","name":"Where's the air conditioner?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/720730/a168ee8c102a70d103dc9fa9b67afd987b3df169.jpg"},{"icon":"a51595fe1a53d33fd5b7309c54074f070672a263.jpg","localized_name":"Stubbornness unleashed!","name":"Stubbornness unleashed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/720730/a51595fe1a53d33fd5b7309c54074f070672a263.jpg"},{"icon":"722e2d789d5ef5d91216b4